---
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
import Marquee from "../components/Marquee.tsx";
import Carousel from "../components/Carousel.astro";
import { Link2 } from "lucide-react";
import Layers from "../components/icons/Layers.tsx";
import Sparkles from "../components/icons/Sparkles.tsx";
import RulerPen from "../components/icons/RulerPen.tsx";
---

<Layout>
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-5xl w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h1
            class="text-4xl max-w-1/2 text-zinc-500 [&_span]:text-zinc-700 [&_span]:font-medium"
        >
            Hello, moi c'est <span>William</span>.<br />
            Je suis Développeur Front-end avec un sens du <span>design</span> et de
            <span>l'animation</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-80 text-zinc-500 font-light">
            Je construis des interfaces React soignées, animées et pensées dans
            le détail.
        </p>
        <a class="font-light" href="#projects">Voir mes projets</a>
    </section>
    <Marquee client:load />
    <section id="projects" class="mb-20">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto pb-10">
            <a
                target="_blank"
                href="https://www.motivai.fr/"
                class="flex items-center gap-4 w-fit"
            >
                <h2 class="text-3xl text-zinc-700 font-medium">Motivai</h2>
                <Link2 size={20} className="text-zinc-500 mt-1" />
            </a>
            <p
                class="text-zinc-500 font-light text-base [&_span]:text-zinc-700 [&_span]:font-normal"
            >
                SaaS de génération de lettres de motivation par IA, développé en
                solo depuis 2024. J'ai conçu l'architecture complète avec
                <span>Next.js</span>, <span>Drizzle ORM</span> et <span
                    >Better Auth</span
                >. L'intégration du <span>Vercel AI SDK</span> permet aux utilisateurs
                de choisir leur modèle d'IA. Un projet formateur sur les défis d'un
                produit complet : CI/CD, environnements multiples et déploiements
                versionnés.
            </p>
        </div>

        <Carousel>
            <div class="embla__slide">
                <video
                    width="100%"
                    height="auto"
                    muted
                    playsinline
                    autoplay
                    loop
                    preload="metadata"
                    tabindex="-1"
                    poster="motivai/motivai-landing.webp"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover rounded-md"
                >
                    <source
                        src="motivai/motivai-landing.mp4"
                        type="video/mp4"
                    />
                </video>
            </div>
            <div class="embla__slide">
                <video
                    width="100%"
                    height="auto"
                    muted
                    playsinline
                    autoplay
                    loop
                    preload="metadata"
                    tabindex="-1"
                    poster="motivai/motivai-onboarding.webp"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover rounded-md"
                >
                    <source
                        src="motivai/motivai-onboarding.mp4"
                        type="video/mp4"
                    />
                </video>
            </div>
            <div class="embla__slide">
                <video
                    width="100%"
                    height="auto"
                    muted
                    playsinline
                    autoplay
                    loop
                    preload="metadata"
                    tabindex="-1"
                    poster="motivai/motivai-aichoose.webp"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover rounded-md"
                >
                    <source
                        src="motivai/motivai-aichoose.mp4"
                        type="video/mp4"
                    />
                </video>
            </div>
        </Carousel>
    </section>
    <section class="bg-zinc-50 py-10">
        <div
            class="max-w-5xl flex justify-between w-5xl mx-auto flex-col gap-4"
        >
            <h2 class="text-zinc-700 font-medium text-2xl">
                Ce qui me différencie
            </h2>
            <p
                class="text-zinc-500 font-light [&_strong]:font-medium max-w-2xl"
            >
                En 2026, un développeur ne fait pas que produire du code. Il
                imagine, structure et donne forme aux idées. Je me situe entre
                <strong>l’architecture</strong>, <strong>le design</strong> et <strong
                    >l’intégration</strong
                >
            </p>
            <div class="my-10 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:justify-between">
                <div
                    class="group relative isolate w-full overflow-clip rounded-md bg-white ring ring-zinc-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-2 md:w-3/10"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/gradient-1.png"
                        alt="Gradient Random"
                        class="absolute -right-8 -top-16 h-fit w-82 max-w-none translate-x-6 -translate-y-8 opacity-30 blur-xl saturate-150 hue-rotate-[190deg] transition-all duration-500 ease group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:opacity-70"
                    />

                    <div
                        class="z-10 relative flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-5 py-8 md:p-6 md:py-10"
                    >
                        <RulerPen className="mb-3 size-7 text-zinc-700 md:mb-4 md:size-8" />
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-700 md:text-2xl">
                            Front-end
                        </h3>
                        <div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-8">
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm md:text-base">
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Composants réutilisables</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Architecture</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >State Management</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Intégration API & Auth</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Optimisation</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <button
                                class="w-full bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-100 font-light py-2 px-4 rounded-md shadow inset-shadow-2xs inset-shadow-zinc-100/30 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-150 text-shadow-2xs ease hover:shadow-xl"
                            >
                                Voir mes projets
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="group relative isolate w-full overflow-clip rounded-md bg-white ring ring-zinc-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-2 md:w-3/10"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/gradient-1.png"
                        alt="Gradient Random"
                        class="absolute -left-4 -top-12 h-fit w-82 max-w-none -translate-y-10 opacity-30 blur-xl saturate-150 hue-rotate-[35deg] transition-all duration-500 ease group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-70"
                    />

                    <div
                        class="z-10 relative flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-5 py-8 md:p-6 md:py-10"
                    >
                        <Layers className="mb-3 size-7 text-zinc-700 md:mb-4 md:size-8" />
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-700 md:text-2xl">
                            UI & Motion
                        </h3>
                        <div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-8">
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm md:text-base">
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Intégration pixel-perfect</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Animations</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Micro-interactions</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Design System & Tokens</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Responsive & Accessibilité</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <button
                                class="w-full bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-100 font-light py-2 px-4 rounded-md shadow inset-shadow-2xs inset-shadow-zinc-100/30 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-150 text-shadow-2xs ease hover:shadow-xl"
                            >
                                Voir ma grotte
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="group relative isolate w-full overflow-clip rounded-md bg-white ring ring-zinc-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-2 md:w-3/10"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/gradient-1.png"
                        alt="Gradient Random"
                        class="absolute -right-6 -top-20 h-fit w-72 max-w-none translate-x-4 -translate-y-6 opacity-15 blur-xl saturate-125 hue-rotate-[110deg] transition-all duration-500 ease group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-30"
                    />
                    <img
                        src="/gradient-1.png"
                        alt="Gradient Random"
                        class="absolute -bottom-20 left-1/2 h-fit w-82 max-w-none -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-16 opacity-30 blur-xl saturate-150 hue-rotate-[110deg] transition-all duration-500 ease group-hover:-translate-x-1/2 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-70"
                    />

                    <div
                        class="z-10 relative flex h-full flex-col gap-4 p-5 py-8 md:p-6 md:py-10"
                    >
                        <Sparkles className="mb-3 size-7 text-zinc-700 md:mb-4 md:size-8" />
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-700 md:text-2xl">
                            IA & Produit
                        </h3>
                        <div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-8">
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm md:text-base">
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Vercel AI SDK</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Streaming & multi-modèles</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >MVP & POC rapides</span
                                >
                                <span
                                    class="text-zinc-700 font-light mix-blend-multiply"
                                    >Prompt engineering</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <button
                                class="w-full bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-100 font-light py-2 px-4 rounded-md shadow inset-shadow-2xs inset-shadow-zinc-100/30 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-150 text-shadow-2xs ease hover:shadow-xl"
                            >
                                Me contacter
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
